                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedo piny, man elwong’o juapar wi ario; ewacu igi kumae, Tek ng’atu moko yenyo ebed ma kwong’ane, ebibedo cen ma sagu ceke, man jatic mi ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
