        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek cingi ketho ikier, thume woko: cika imond i kwo kud abala, sagu ma tek icidho i gehena ku cingi ario, i mac ma negre ngo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.43",
