              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek tiendi ketho ikier, thume woko: cika imond i kwo kud abala sagu ma tek ibedo ku tiendi ario ma jubibei ko i gehena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
